       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-RAMAN-CRYS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RAMAN-CRYS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PHONON-SHIFT-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHASE-INVARIANCE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEMP-EQUILIBRIUM-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAMAN-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAMAN-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RAMAN-CRYS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PRC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PRC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PHONON-AND-PHASE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TEMP-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PHONON-AND-PHASE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHONON-SHIFT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE-INVARIANCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-TEMP-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEMP-EQUILIBRIUM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAMAN-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PHONON-SHIFT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHASE-INVARIANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TEMP-EQUILIBRIUM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RAMAN-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RAMAN-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PRC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PRC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PRC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PRC-CODE.
